    "revision": 7,
    "title": "Extend affected-object constructions",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk6-ba-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Extend affected-object constructions",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "A cause need not be human in a 把 clause. Track the cause and affected participant; the 把 object may itself be a person who experiences a result. The initial cause can be an encountered object such as a book, while the 把 object is the person who acts and experiences the resulting state. This is a cause-result construction, not a literal agent manipulating a patient.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这件事把我累坏了。",
                "pinyin": "zhè jiàn shì bǎ wǒ lèi huài le 。",
                "meaning": "This matter exhausted me.",
                "audio": "efa8924c0a78ae605e5a0e7d47dcf6873d49634ee2296d0a24b3909843149fef"
              },
              {
                "text": "大雨把路冲坏了。",
                "pinyin": "dà yǔ bǎ lù chōng huài le 。",
                "meaning": "The heavy rain washed out the road.",
                "audio": "bdeace3b13bf72fb8ec3bf99d2656edacb2dde0755209a848ce50d200a4e467d"
              },
              {
                "text": "这本书把我看哭了。",
                "pinyin": "zhè běn shū bǎ wǒ kàn kū le 。",
                "meaning": "Reading this book made me cry.",
                "audio": "de729fc3c856a214bdbf50cd448f09f0139ca46a9270cf2f045955f0923ca4ea"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "把",
                "pinyin": "bǎ",
                "meaning": "marker introducing the affected object",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "950a2674d9993a8504affc5618b1ea5dff8c56326c03a91903a248fa4b762429"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
